source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Tune a source: every-digest, changes-only, muted or breakthrough (every message at the top of Needs a look with a suggested to-do)

Usage: mxr updates source [OPTIONS] <SOURCE> <SETTING>

Arguments:
  <SOURCE>   A source key as the digest prints it, or an address it sends from
  <SETTING>  every-digest, changes-only, muted or breakthrough

Options:
      --dry-run
      --cut <CUT>          A past cut, as its time ("08:00") or RFC3339; the latest cut when omitted
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
